                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Delicious cake!! The whipped cream wasn\u0027t too sweet at all.\nThe cake base was Earl Grey tea~\nHighly recommend!\nBut the service took quite a while, so there was a long wait. It was also very crowded 🤣 It probably takes quite a while from arriving to starting to eat.\n\nThe service was excellent, and the environment was very clean!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "好吃的蛋糕！！鮮奶油完全不甜膩\n蛋糕體是伯爵茶～\n推推\n但上菜時間蠻久的要等\n現場人也很多🤣還是要等\n去現場到開始吃應該要蠻久的\n\n服務態度很好 環境很乾淨！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
