                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0NFZXbElkbGxIVUc1UGFUUlZiVkpMVTJoeGQwRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442abbe3194a909:0x1ab05f904e4c4c6c"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJCamUMb6rQjQRbExMTpBfsBo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SNVpuZFdkMUppZDBSeVJVUlFSbVJrYW04elNXYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Minimum spend is one drink; there are quite a few options, the sesame and matcha lattes are both good. Even on a weekday evening, it\u0027s quite crowded, but there are still a few seats available.\n\nThe most popular dishes are:\n\nSpicy Tomato Chicken Spaghetti: The chicken is very tender and not too spicy, bringing out the sweetness of the tomatoes, creating a layered flavor.\n\nGarlic Spicy Shrimp and Sausage Spaghetti: The shrimp flavor is strong but not fishy. A must-order signature dish. The sauce seems to be made by sautéing shrimp heads, but it\u0027s not greasy at all; instead, it\u0027s refreshing and very flavorful.\n\nFor this price, the spaghetti is really delicious, but I seem to prefer another branch. Although it\u0027s more crowded, the overall cooking here is more memorable (maybe my expectations are too high because I\u0027ve been looking forward to it for so long). Still, it\u0027s worth a try.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "低消一杯飲品，選項蠻多的，芝麻跟抹茶拿鐵都不錯，平日晚上去人也不少還有零星的位子\n\n最多人點的就是：\n\n辣番茄雞肉義大利麵，雞肉很嫩也不會太辣，反而帶出番茄的甜味，整體味道是有層次惡\n\n蒜辣鮮蝦臘腸義大利麵：蝦味很濃而且沒有腥味，店裡的招牌必點，醬汁應該是用蝦頭去爆香，不過吃起來沒有油膩感反而偏清爽，不過非常夠味\n\n以這個價位以義大利麵真的好吃，但我好像更偏愛另外一家分店。雖然比較擁擠但整體的烹調比起這邊好像再更有記憶點（也可能是我存太久期待太高）不過還是可以來吃看看",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
